    given-names: "Mert"
    affiliation: "Mersin University"
year: 2026
version: "0.2.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mertdurukan/tooth-resorption-detection"
abstract: >-
  Medical computer vision pipeline that classifies wisdom-tooth root
  resorption on panoramic dental X-rays. Compares a from-scratch CNN
  baseline against an ImageNet-pretrained ViT-Base/16, lifting macro-F1
  from 0.20 to 0.90 on the same held-out test split.
keywords:
  - medical-imaging
  - dental-xray
  - vision-transformer
  - transfer-learning
  - pytorch
references:
